# Build tools, installed first from this lock into each venv. pip is locked
# because the one bundled with Debian's python3-venv (25.1.1) cannot connect to an
# https:// index addressed by IP, which a lab mirror may be. A few dependencies
# ship only as pure-Python source and build without isolation, so setuptools and
# wheel are installed from here and never fetched unpinned.
pip==26.2.1
setuptools
wheel
